refnum, Image cluster) the\n   thing that must match, and will a Save-As copy disconnected from the lvlib keep them?\n4. PD16(e): any prediction that cannot fail, or cannot pass (e.g. pixel md5 of an IMAQ image vs the file md5).\n\nAnswer with the specific clause refuted (if any) and the cheapest test that would separate your alternative.\n"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01QDuJC3q3NBS2gGDHgfJVCQ","tool_input":{"command":"cd \"G:/Codes/LabVIEW_Codes/MinLab/zz_LabView VI/AAA_UNIST/2. Tracking/V6_ParallelLoop\" && MATERIAL=1 py tools/bgrun.py --max-min 20 --log tools/bench/replay_vis_76b_peer.log -- powershell -NoProfile -Command \"& 'tools/peer.ps1' -Agent claude -Role hypothesis -Slug m8b-pd16-replay-76 -TaskFile 'tools/bench/cards/peer_76-3-pd16_task.md' -ReviewCard 'tools/bench/cards/review_76-3-pd16.json' -TimeoutSec 900\"","description":"Dispatch the hypothesis review of PD16 in background","run_in_background":true}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01DCYgWwhVneWUBafhCeBREJ","tool_input":{"command":"MATERIAL=1 py tools/bgrun.py --max-min 20 --log tools/bench/replay_vis_76b_peer.log -- powershell -NoProfile -Command \"& 'tools/peer.ps1' -Agent claude -Role hypothesis -Slug m8b-pd16-replay-76 -TaskFile 'tools/bench/cards/peer_76-3-pd16_task.md' -ReviewCard 'tools/bench/cards/review_76-3-pd16.json' -TimeoutSec 900\"","description":"Dispatch the hypothesis review of PD16 in background","run_in_background":true}},{"tool_name":"PowerShell","tool_use_id":"toolu_01HGTR9Fiiqpw2ifdsWEifby","tool_input":{"command":"$env:MATERIAL='1'; py tools\\bgrun.py --max-min 20 --log tools/bench/replay_vis_76b_peer.log -- powershell -NoProfile -Command \"& 'tools/peer.ps1' -Agent claude -Role hypothesis -Slug m8b-pd16-replay-76 -TaskFile 'tools/bench/cards/peer_76-3-pd16_task.md' -ReviewCard 'tools/bench/cards/review_76-3-pd16.json' -TimeoutSec 900\"","description":"Dispatch the hypothesis review of PD16 in background","run_in_background":true}},{"tool_name":"PowerS